# Qualification evidence retention - generated disposable TLS credentials.
# The R1 harness creates an ephemeral certificate and key per run inside the
# results directory (see R1Harness/Program.cs Certificates.Create). The key is
# disposable, never reusable, and must never be tracked. Public certificates and
# journals remain trackable. Narrowed to the qualification results tree so that
# legitimate source keys elsewhere are not concealed.
docs/reviews/Q-B5B-09-TLS-LINUX-QUAL-01/results/**/cert/*.key
docs/reviews/Q-B5B-09-TLS-LINUX-QUAL-01-R1/results/**/cert/*.key
